# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Impact Store — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev, and add the same keys in Vercel
# (Project → Settings → Environment Variables). Never commit real keys.
# The store works without any of these: checkout falls back to Cash on
# Delivery via WhatsApp. Add these to switch on the other options.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Direct UPI (works with just a UPI ID — no gateway or KYC).
# Turns on the "Pay by UPI" option: the customer's UPI app opens pre-filled
# with your ID and the amount; they pay you and send a screenshot on WhatsApp.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_UPI_VPA=yourname@okhdfcbank
# NEXT_PUBLIC_UPI_NAME=Impact Store

# Razorpay (UPI + credit/debit cards + netbanking). Requires a Razorpay
# merchant account with KYC done: https://dashboard.razorpay.com
# The KEY_ID is public; the KEY_SECRET must stay server-side only.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxx
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
